.         
.         label define agree 0 "no" 1 "yes"

.         recode plh0308_v2 (1/5 = 0) (6/7 = 1)
(1,263 changes made to plh0308_v2)

.         label values plh0308_v2 agree

.         recode plh0308_v1 (2/4 = 0)
(235 changes made to plh0308_v1)

